<div class="chapter_content content" id="7678876_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany as indicated in Part histories. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Bonds of City officials; facsimile signature and seal; notes — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7678262" href="7678262#7678262">18</a>.</div><div class="para">Bureau of Buildings — See Ch. 20.</div><div class="para">Courts and legal procedures — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7678297" href="7678297#7678297">30</a>.</div><div class="para">Defense and indemnification of employees — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7678853" href="7678853#7678853">38</a>.</div><div class="para">Equal employment opportunity; affirmative action; unlawful discriminatory practices — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680208" href="7680208#7680208">48</a>.</div><div class="para">Financial disclosure — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680442" href="7680442#7680442">54</a>.</div><div class="para">Fiscal year and annual estimate — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680470" href="7680470#7680470">57</a>.</div><div class="para">Printing; publication; publicity — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680503" href="7680503#7680503">74</a>.</div><div class="para">Traffic Violations Bureau — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680550" href="7680550#7680550">90</a>.</div><div class="para">Youth Bureau — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7680559" href="7680559#7680559">98</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


